; LowRider V4 CURRENT AXES: X short / single motor, Y long / dual motor.
; AIR-MOTION TEST ONLY. KEEP THE ROUTER PHYSICALLY OFF.
; 100 mm diameter circle, center work X75 Y75, bounds X25..125 Y25..125.
; Work Z40 mm throughout the loop, with at least Z50 available for Pause.
; Feed 1800 mm/min = 30 mm/s at Run speed 100%; approximately 10.47 s/lap.
; Infinite native SD-card loop, processed as short G1 moves for Pause/Resume.
; Stop with Cancel, or send SDCARD_LOOP_DESIST to finish the current lap.
; E-stop shuts Klipper down: it cannot be resumed. Restart and rehome afterward.
; No homing or work-zero reset. Start only after checking the work origin and clearance.
G21
G90
CNC_TEST_PREFLIGHT KIND=CIRCLE
M220 S100
LED_ON
START_JOB
G1 Z40.000 F600
G1 X125.000 Y75.000 F1200
G1 F1800
